      "name": "a-section-rename-wins-without-carrying-the-renamers-slot",
      "bug": "lc-l85",
      "why": "The title is resolved against titleChangedAt and nothing else. The renamer holds the LOWER uuid, so a rename folded into the section representative's createdAt would lose the tie outright; and the section representative here is the OTHER author's, so a title that carried its author's whole row would move the section from slot 5 to slot 0. titleChangedAt travels with the title it won, because adopting a section republishes it verbatim.",
